A '''Prayer potion''' is a [[Herblore#Potions|potion]] made by using [[snape grass]] on a [[ranarr potion (unf)]], requiring 38 [[Herblore]], yielding a Prayer potion(3) and 87.5 Herblore [[experience]]. A dose of Prayer potion restores [[Prayer]] points equal to 7 + 25% of the player's current Prayer level, rounded down. If a [[Prayer cape]], [[Max cape]] or [[ring of the gods (i)]] is equipped or a [[Prayer cape]], [[Max cape]] or [[holy wrench]] is in the player's inventory, the restore increases to 7 + 27% of the player's current Prayer level, rounded down. It provides less Prayer point restoration than a [[super restore]] potion by 1 point per dose.

Prayer potions are always in high demand due to use of Prayers during combat or skilling activities and a need to restore points without travelling to an [[altar]]. 

After [[Barbarian Training#Barbarian Herblore|Barbarian Herblore Training]], [[caviar]] can be added to a Prayer potion(2), requiring 42 Herblore, yielding a [[Prayer mix]] and 29 Herblore experience. A Prayer mix has 2 doses, restores Prayer by the same amounts, and heals 6 [[Hitpoints]], with the disadvantage being it now incurs an attack delay.

